ent-ActionCultYoggCorruptItem = Corrupt an Item by Touch
    .desc = Reshape an item into the form intended by its creator.
ent-ActionCultYoggCorruptItemInHand = Corrupt an Item in Hand
    .desc = Reshape an item in your hands into the form intended by its creator.
ent-ActionCultYoggPukeShroom = Regurgitate
    .desc = Regurgitate the mushroom growing in your stomach.
ent-ActionCultYoggDigest = Mycosis
    .desc = Spend some nutrients and water to digest a new mushroom.
ent-ActionMiGoEnslavement = Enslavement
